                        "target_lang_word": "incentive",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incentive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a01b9e54-9bce-3cd0-9e88-21fcc436e7a6",
                                        "entry_id": "831ce258-dc2a-331c-9a94-a0bd253fcc06",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that motivates, rouses, or encourages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b7f486b-59a6-4e05-a292-8afd358a3d28",
                                                "sense_id": "a01b9e54-9bce-3cd0-9e88-21fcc436e7a6",
                                                "text": "I have no incentive to do housework right now."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea9ae759-9ccc-48b1-9d63-3851d10444e9",
                                                "sense_id": "a01b9e54-9bce-3cd0-9e88-21fcc436e7a6",
                                                "text": "It is tempting to speculate about the incentives or compulsions that might explain why anyone would take to the skies in [the] basket [of a balloon]: perhaps out of a desire to escape the gravity of this world or to get a preview of the next; […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8ad0c9a-bcc9-3bd2-aac8-b034de7f5fca",
                                        "entry_id": "831ce258-dc2a-331c-9a94-a0bd253fcc06",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bonus or reward, often monetary, to work harder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83e16813-99ab-4b8f-963d-263e3a9843ca",
                                                "sense_id": "d8ad0c9a-bcc9-3bd2-aac8-b034de7f5fca",
                                                "text": "Management offered the sales team a $500 incentive for each car sold."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "incentive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8569ce5d-aacb-3d4f-9afe-3426cfaf54f9",
                                        "entry_id": "1daa9f0a-a294-360a-98fc-29e4cbf1f484",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inciting; encouraging or moving; rousing to action; stimulating."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "727c9282-6181-403a-be3d-799189e562c8",
                                                "sense_id": "8569ce5d-aacb-3d4f-9afe-3426cfaf54f9",
                                                "text": "Competency is of all other proportions the most incentive to industry."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7eadf8b0-c67f-34cf-9f27-d9011f82a7ed",
                                        "entry_id": "1daa9f0a-a294-360a-98fc-29e4cbf1f484",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Serving to kindle or set on fire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e4d60b6-b7e1-424d-bd39-275845e54575",
                                                "sense_id": "7eadf8b0-c67f-34cf-9f27-d9011f82a7ed",
                                                "text": "Part incentive reed / Provide, pernicious with one touch of fire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0c016f4e-2296-4d79-af63-57ca1aa1db50",
                        "source_entry_id": "7d891447-5c68-3017-93e8-d42e46d8c83d",
                        "source_sense_id": "ba6eb9f9-dbe1-3b33-8b84-e3f3609b6f38",
                        "target_lang_word": "encouragement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "encouragement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5787c560-ae3b-33e3-9c85-9e38d90d9d9f",
                                        "entry_id": "e66856b1-37fd-3114-adda-1b6cfd567120",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of encouraging"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d78f5883-6532-3cd6-9655-ec09e0b70861",
                                        "entry_id": "e66856b1-37fd-3114-adda-1b6cfd567120",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that incites, supports, promotes, protects or advances; incentive"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a67402c-09c1-4dc6-9be3-4af2f53c2b71",
                                                "sense_id": "d78f5883-6532-3cd6-9655-ec09e0b70861",
                                                "text": "even their arch-enemy the gamekeeper is beginning reluctantly, but gradually, to acquiesce in the general belief of their innocence and utility, I cannot help indulging the hope that this bird will eventually meet with that general encouragement and protection to which its eminent services so richly entitle it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6090bd6-4c2d-4daa-9c18-3e38dfdb4979",
                                                "sense_id": "d78f5883-6532-3cd6-9655-ec09e0b70861",
                                                "text": "The train was handed over 21 min. late at Salisbury, so there was every encouragement to Driver Moore, of Salisbury, to \"get a move on.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e0a5329-d3fd-38d0-9ce6-fcbe2e004fc8",
                                        "entry_id": "e66856b1-37fd-3114-adda-1b6cfd567120",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Words or actions that increase someone's confidence"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2310dfba-b304-4852-b75b-aff5b30f3433",
                                                "sense_id": "1e0a5329-d3fd-38d0-9ce6-fcbe2e004fc8",
                                                "text": "7 January 2017, Adharanand Finn writing in The Guardian, The 24-hour race: 'It is a battle with your mind'\nDiana Celeiro has come all the way from Argentina for the race. It’s her second time here. Her husband, Gustavo, acts as her support crew. Most of the runners have someone who stands diligently by the track watching, offering encouragement, preparing snacks or helping with any issues that arise, from blisters to emotional breakdowns."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "101bc6d9-85a2-4e22-9139-4f023a601d9c",
                                                "sense_id": "1e0a5329-d3fd-38d0-9ce6-fcbe2e004fc8",
                                                "text": "If I live, an' please your honour, but once to get through it, I will never tell it again, quoth Trim, either to man, woman, or child--Poo--poo! said my uncle Toby--but with accents of such sweet encouragement did he utter it, that the corporal went on with his story with more alacrity than ever."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94760d1d-86a4-37c8-af95-af7897e32033",
                                        "entry_id": "e66856b1-37fd-3114-adda-1b6cfd567120",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The feeling of being encouraged"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
